From: Christopher Owen <3221756+christopherowen@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 10 Oct 2026 10:21:53 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] TileLang V4.1 KV-cache record writers

The SWA (528-byte E4M3 plus UE8M0) and indexed (288-byte E2M1 plus E4M3)
records of DeepSeek-V4.1's paged caches, one thread per quantization group,
with B12X write_cache's arithmetic step for step: the power-of-two scale
bump and its exact reciprocal, the IEEE amax / 6 and division by the decoded
E4M3 scale, nearest-even E2M1. Tested byte for byte against a torch replica
over flat, padded and record-shaped pages. Nothing calls it yet.
---
